# TypeScript / React

- Strict TypeScript; avoid `any`; prefer `interface` for object shapes.
- Named exports; functional components; boolean prefixes (`is`, `has`, `can`).
- Server Components + Server Actions first.
- Form Server Actions must return `void` / `Promise<void>` when passed to `<form action={...}>`.
- Zod schemas for shared inputs live in `@campuz360/contracts`.
- Keep files lean (~150 lines); extract helpers instead of growing god components.
